  "source_pdf": "downloads/wukong-and-the-snowy-zigzags-v7-zh-Hans.pdf",
  "source_sha256": "d5bd323809ad0f03bc23e84f10258efaaf64011e6bf9385d8b7afb7d9cbbedf1",
  "pixel_width": 1224,
  "pages": [
    {
      "image": "page-01.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "49b09f617a0f7e38e68a31035975c37a33a86a005332ee0fd8c4f4ef857aa7df",
      "text": "悟空的\n雪地弯弯",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-02.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "c7d095c85a1d97216f6e916c30ca31f857dd85656c8e52c72a6cb4c3acbd5a56",
      "text": "玉兔挥挥手。\n“欢迎你，悟空！”\n“欢迎你，铁扇公主！”",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-03.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "e85307e969dd78189440580b9605850c183c151c18b3abc57172aa8a3a22bc77",
      "text": "金箍棒和铁扇子，\n都收进小柜子里。\n穿好雪靴，踩上雪板。",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-04.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "8df7e757a5b0e4134aea62a0e2fab6040f0ce6b32ca4af1234762458c8d1d1d5",
      "text": "“我的脚变长啦！”\n悟空摇摇晃晃，\n两块雪板滑向两边。",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-05.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "7104a683a84aa06679e75916ed29c027aa428e5bca412a045af1ea6d6e0b8f59",
      "text": "水獭教练挨个检查头盔。\n“先在小缓坡上练习哦。”\n大家认真听。",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-06.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "4a8ad63b242d108f0c29e88836e17b6818eee9ebdad7fb0ff7f8cf89261ae43e",
      "text": "悟空迈得太快啦。\n扑通！坐进软软的雪里。\n尾巴上顶着一个雪球。",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-07.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "ee7d07c55e8d4e3fbb054a7900ebfd1eeab03f96d7ac2e7b53fa336997865743",
      "text": "铁扇公主坐进软雪里。\n“公主专用的雪坐垫！”\n她哈哈大笑。",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-08.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "4a18511f807b4b64af4dea8132e8147f351694fa6a950ba6d7718f1992c69cc7",
      "text": "她“唰”地停下来。\n“前面那个弯好大呀，\n我能转过去吗？”",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-09.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "b75306a54621c1d2c6cee8d49933d219e97e59c2335e35ce20b5c32898aa1d1b",
      "text": "悟空弯弯膝盖，\n抬头看着坡下。\n“慢慢来，别着急。”",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-10.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "38fef31f81ef95d41774c6be858d83bf3a25478a5178683815019bbe2d1d1a14",
      "text": "教练用小旗标出宽宽的路。\n玉兔在旁边喊：“慢慢来！”\n悟空认真听。",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-11.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "df6d2adbce9472865ecd83f207f40be4a8c67a495e3eed824a6cf675611a5ba3",
      "text": "铁扇公主慢慢呼了口气。\n弯弯膝盖，转个小弯，\n雪板绕过了小旗。",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-12.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "a1739573d8b13e534b4ab916c4293d5f7602fffcaf5b068a966fcc2d78d00625",
      "text": "悟空弯弯膝盖，转个弯。\n“慢慢滑。转个弯。停！”\n他停在小旗旁边。",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-13.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "0f884c34934089d80a1ea5d92123a9ad89dcba7695b8e60407be4590b6230a75",
      "text": "他们回头看。\n雪地上，两条弯弯的线\n交叉在一起。\n“像两条丝带！”玉兔喊。",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-14.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "f740871eb6b1e913e289a34e022786bb69819fef2f5fa8e4b006e8e3ded77187",
      "text": "三杯暖暖的热可可，\n一碗小鱼饼干。\n吹一吹，再喝一小口。",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-15.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "09293b7b6ce06ef6e62423f06f7d2483f767cd3313ea184ef3c3e57e52651362",
      "text": "“我的小鱼不会滑雪！”\n“我的小鱼会游泳……\n游进我的肚子里！”\n咔嚓，咔嚓。",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-16.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "7a333d5032e21f7ebd3fe061d3af190b6b9ca2eacbfdcc0589e7e0383dbe387a",
      "text": "他们画下弯弯的滑雪路线。\n玉兔添上小小的雪花。\n窗外，雪花轻轻飘。\n屋里，可可还暖暖的。",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-17.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "d5fe2412537ab0ab9a468f8fb7e11a30b221231ff6b956d3c19f2625a27017f1",
      "text": "Wukong & Friends\n谢谢你们一起读故事！\n希望你和孩子\n喜欢这次小小的冒险。\n更多免费故事\nphg1024.github.io/wukong-and-friends/zh\n免费阅读、下载和打印。\n阅读更多免费故事\n如果你和孩子喜欢这些故事，\n欢迎支持我继续创作。支持完全自愿。\nBuy Me a Coffee\nGitHub Sponsors\nPeihong Guo 创作\n这些故事和插画由作者借助 AI 创作，并经过人工编辑。\n© 2026 Peihong Guo\nCC BY-NC-ND 4.0 · 署名—非商业性使用—禁止演绎\ncreativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc-nd/4.0/",
