    },
    {
      "image": "page-18.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "45c58522e8dfac53f5c35cd35d11ee0ef5086126034477f0ad5c4bc9d6add566",
      "text": "Wukong & Friends\n慢慢滑，转个弯。\n和朋友喝杯热可可，\n暖暖和和歇一歇。\nphg1024.github.io/wukong-and-friends/zh",
